# Advisory notes for a hypothetical apps/dashboard build context.
#
# The dashboard Compose service currently uses the repository root as its
# build context, so Docker consumes the ROOT .dockerignore for that build,
# NOT this file. This file is advisory only: it records the intended
# exclusions if the dashboard context is ever narrowed to apps/dashboard.
# Deterministic context today comes from the root .dockerignore denylist
# plus the narrow COPY list in apps/dashboard/Dockerfile.dev (root package
# files, packages/shared, apps/dashboard only).

node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
.open-next/
.turbo/
.wrangler/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
*.dev.vars
.git
